        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium arsenide, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium arsenide, at plant
The process "sodium arsenide, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  sodium arsenide from zinc production  in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 012044-25-6; 
Formula: AsNa3; 
UUID: 77e6c67c-4aaf-3ce2-b049-e630b1743fcc
Production of sodium arsenide including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: removal of arsenide from zinc
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_77e6c67c-4aaf-3ce2-b049-e630b1743fcc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
